{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The importer rejects the leading `+` in `+2.750,00`, then stores the salary with a `None` amount. The report crashes when it multiplies that amount by EUR’s rate of 1. It can also silently skip malformed amounts on “Saldo” rows. I’ll accept positive signs and restrict skipping to balance rows whose amount cell is blank; unreadable amounts will raise a file-and-line error before anything is added."}}
