{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"Fixed the Rabobank importer. It rejected `+2.750,00` and stored `None`; reporting then crashed while multiplying by EUR’s rate of 1.\n\nImports now accept `+` amounts, skip only blank balance rows, and reject unreadable amounts with a filename and line number before adding anything.\n\nMarch’s totals are:\n\n- Income: **€2,750.00**\n- Expenses: **€1,084.35**\n- Net: **€1,665.65**\n\nRegression tests cover totals, deduplication, and atomic failures. All **38 tests pass** with `python -m unittest discover -s tests`.\n\nPreviously saved `null` amounts aren’t repaired automatically; those entries need removal and reimport."}}
